#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:2
msgid "Decorators"
msgstr "裝飾器"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:4
msgid ""
"A *decorator* is a piece of syntax that wraps a function (or a method) in "
"another function. The wrapper can add behaviour before and after the "
"original call, replace the return value, or attach metadata. The shape is:"
msgstr "*裝飾器* 是一種語法，它將一個函式（或方法）包裹在另一個函式中。包裹器可以在原始呼叫前後新增行為、替換回傳值，或附加中介資料。其形式為："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:15
msgid ""
"The ``@wrapper`` line is equivalent to ``f = wrapper(f)`` -- the function "
"``f`` is built normally, then handed to ``wrapper``, and the result is "
"rebound to the name ``f``."
msgstr ""
"``@wrapper`` 這一行等同於 ``f = wrapper(f)`` -- 函式 ``f`` 先正常建立，接著交給 ``wrapper``\\ "
"，其結果再重新繫結到名稱 ``f``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:19
msgid ""
"A function entering a \"wrapper\" box on the left and\n"
"emerging on the right as a decorated function."
msgstr ""
"一個函式從左側進入「包裹器」方框，\n"
"並從右側以裝飾過的函式形式浮現。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:19
msgid ".. image:: ../figures/decorator-wrap.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/decorator-wrap.svg"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:23
msgid "A decorator takes a function in and returns a new function."
msgstr "裝飾器接收一個函式，並回傳一個新的函式。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:26
msgid "Built-in method decorators"
msgstr "內建的方法裝飾器"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:28
msgid "A few decorators ship with Python and are used inside class bodies."
msgstr "Python 內建了少數幾個裝飾器，用於類別主體中。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:32
msgid "@property"
msgstr "@property"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:34
msgid ""
"Turns a method into a *computed attribute*. The caller accesses it as if it "
"were a plain attribute (no parentheses), but a method runs on each read:"
msgstr "將方法轉變為 *計算屬性*\\ 。呼叫者像存取普通屬性一樣存取它（不加括號），但每次讀取時都會執行一個方法："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:51
msgid ""
"Use it when an attribute that *looks* simple needs a tiny computation behind"
" it. If the work is expensive, prefer a regular method -- callers do not "
"expect attribute reads to be slow."
msgstr ""
"當某個 *看起來* 簡單的屬性背後需要進行少量計算時，可使用它。如果這項工作很耗費資源，則改用一般方法 -- 呼叫者不會預期讀取屬性會很慢。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:57
msgid "@classmethod"
msgstr "@classmethod"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:59
msgid ""
"Defines a method that receives the *class* as its first argument instead of "
"an instance. The first parameter is conventionally named ``cls``:"
msgstr "定義一個以 *類別* 而非實例作為第一個引數的方法。第一個參數依慣例命名為 ``cls``\\ ："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:76
msgid ""
"Class methods are the standard way to provide *alternative constructors* -- "
"factory functions that return an instance built in a non-default way."
msgstr "類別方法是提供 *替代建構子* 的標準方式 -- 也就是以非預設方式建立並回傳實例的工廠函式。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:81
msgid "@staticmethod"
msgstr "@staticmethod"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:83
msgid ""
"Defines a method that receives neither the instance nor the class -- it is "
"just a plain function that lives in the class namespace for organisational "
"reasons:"
msgstr "定義一個既不接收實例也不接收類別的方法 -- 它只是一個基於組織考量而存在於類別命名空間中的普通函式："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:96
msgid ""
"Use it sparingly; if a function really has nothing to do with the class's "
"state, a plain module-level function is usually cleaner."
msgstr "請審慎使用；如果某個函式其實與類別的狀態毫無關係，使用普通的模組層級函式通常更為清楚。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:101
msgid "Writing a custom decorator"
msgstr "撰寫自訂裝飾器"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:103
msgid ""
"A decorator is a function that takes a function and returns a function. The "
"minimum shape:"
msgstr "裝飾器是一個接收函式並回傳函式的函式。最精簡的形式："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:120
msgid "Output::"
msgstr "輸出::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/classes/decorators.rst:124
msgid ""
"The ``wrapper`` closes over ``func`` and forwards everything to it. "
"``*args`` / ``**kwargs`` lets it work on any function, not just two-argument"
" ones. This pattern is the foundation of more elaborate decorators (timing, "
"caching, retry-on-failure) but the core is always the same: take a function "
"in, return a function out."
msgstr ""
"``wrapper`` 對 ``func`` 形成閉包，並將一切轉發給它。\\ ``*args`` / ``**kwargs`` "
"讓它能作用於任何函式，而不僅限於只有兩個引數的函式。這種模式是更複雜裝飾器（計時、快取、失敗重試）的基礎，但其核心始終相同：接收一個函式，回傳一個函式。"
